{"start":"t:div","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/shacharit/shema/deuteronomy_6","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n110.jpg"}}
{"text":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"6","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/shacharit/shema/deuteronomy_6/chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/shacharit/shema/deuteronomy_6/chapter/5","n":"5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:deuteronomy/6/5"}}
{"text":"You shall love the Lord your God with all your heart and with all your soul and with all your possession."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/shacharit/shema/deuteronomy_6/chapter/6","n":"6"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:deuteronomy/6/6"}}
{"text":"These words which I command you this day, shall be upon your heart."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/shacharit/shema/deuteronomy_6/chapter/7","n":"7"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:deuteronomy/6/7"}}
{"text":"You shall inculcate them in your children and speak of them when you sit in your house and when you walk on the way, when you lie down and when you rise up."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/shacharit/shema/deuteronomy_6/chapter/8","n":"8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:deuteronomy/6/8"}}
{"text":"You shall bind them for a sign upon your arm and they shall be frontlets between your eyes."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/shacharit/shema/deuteronomy_6/chapter/9","n":"9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:deuteronomy/6/9"}}
{"text":"You shall write them upon the doorposts of your house and upon your gates."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
